#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:53
msgid "Color Rate"
msgstr "Rýchlosť farieb"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:55
msgid ""
"How much of the foreground color is added to the smudging mix. Works "
"together with :ref:`option_smudge_length` and :ref:`option_smudge_radius`."
msgstr ""
"Koľko popredia farby sa pridáva do zmesi rozmazávania. Funguje spoločne s :"
"ref:`option_smudge_length` a :ref:`option_smudge_radius`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:59
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_color_rate_smear.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2_9_brushengine_colorrate_04.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:59
msgid ""
"A variety of color smudge strokes in the :dfn:`Smear Mode` with different "
"opacities, smudge lengths and spacing. All are with 50% :dfn:`Color Rate`. "
"Left-hand set being the old algorithm and the right-hand set the new "
"algorithm. The bottom two strokes are using the :ref:`bm_color_dodge` "
"blending mode."
msgstr ""
"Rôzne ťahy štetca color smudge v :dfn:`Smear Mode` s rôznym krytím, dĺžkami "
"rozmazania a rozstupmi. Všetky majú 50% :dfn:`Color Rate`. Ľavá sada používa "
"starý algoritmus, pravá sada nový algoritmus. Spodné dva ťahy používajú "
"režim miešania :ref:`bm_color_dodge`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:63
msgid ""
"The option :guilabel:`Use new smudge algorithm` greatly affects how the :dfn:"
"`Color Rate` works. With the old algorithm, the :dfn:`Color Rate` will be "
"affected by both smudge length and opacity, while with the new algorithm, :"
"dfn:`Color Rate` will only interact with :dfn:`Opacity`."
msgstr ""
"Možnosť :guilabel:`Use new smudge algorithm` výrazne ovplyvňuje fungovanie :"
"dfn:`Color Rate`. So starým algoritmom je :dfn:`Color Rate` ovplyvnená "
"dĺžkou rozmazania aj krytím, zatiaľ čo s novým algoritmom :dfn:`Color Rate` "
"interaguje iba s :dfn:`Opacity`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:65
msgid ""
"At first glance, this may seem like it reduces nuance. But instead, the new "
"algorithm simplifies brush creation, with it being far clearer which "
"elements interact with :dfn:`Color Rate`."
msgstr ""
"Na prvý pohľad sa môže zdať, že tým sa zmenšuje nuansia. Naopak, nový "
"algoritmus zjednodušuje tvorbu štetcov, pričom je oveľa jasnejšie, ktoré "
"prvky interagujú s :dfn:`Color Rate`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:69
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_color_rate_dulling.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2_9_brushengine_colorrate_04.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:69
msgid "Same as figure above, but then in :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."
msgstr "Rovnaké ako obrázok vyššie, ale v :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:71
msgid ""
"Using the new algorithm, turning off the smudge length is all that's needed "
"to make a brush that is similar to the :ref:`pixel_brush_engine`. This is "
"useful as a starting point for brushes that only need a little smudge."
msgstr ""
"Pri použití nového algoritmu stačí vypnúť dĺžku rozmazania na vytvorenie "
"štetca podobného :ref:`pixel_brush_engine`. Je to užitočný východiskový bod "
"pre štetce, ktoré potrebujú len malé rozmazanie."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:73
msgid ""
"When using the :ref:`gradient mode <brush_mode>`, the :dfn:`Color Rate` will "
"control the colored brush tip instead of a flat color."
msgstr ""
"Pri použití :ref:`režimu gradientu <brush_mode>` bude :dfn:`Color Rate` "
"riadiť farebný hrot štetca namiesto plnej farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:75
msgid ""
"Blending modes are applied when the color part is composed onto the smudge "
"part. This effectively means that color smudge brushes with a blending mode "
"other than :ref:`bm_normal` will be greatly affected by :dfn:`Color Rate` in "
"addition to :ref:`option_spacing` and :ref:`opacity <option_opacity_n_flow>`."
msgstr ""
"Režimy miešania sa uplatňujú pri skombinovaní farebnej časti s časťou "
"rozmazania. To v praxi znamená, že štetce color smudge s iným režimom "
"miešania ako :ref:`bm_normal` budú výrazne ovplyvnené :dfn:`Color Rate` "
"okrem :ref:`option_spacing` a :ref:`krytia <option_opacity_n_flow>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:80
msgid "Smudge Length"
msgstr "Dĺžka rozmazania"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:82
msgid ""
"Affects smudging and allows you to set it to Sensors. Smudging is greatly "
"affected by :ref:`option_spacing` as well as :ref:`Opacity "
"<option_opacity_n_flow>`. The former controls how many dabs are placed, and "
"thus how many samples are made. This results in a smoother result for :dfn:"
"`Smear Mode`, and a more opaque result for :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."
msgstr ""
"Ovplyvňuje rozmazávanie a umožňuje jeho nastavenie pomocou senzorov. "
"Rozmazávanie je výrazne ovplyvnené :ref:`option_spacing` a tiež :ref:`krytím "
"<option_opacity_n_flow>`. Prvý parameter určuje, koľko dábov sa umiestni, a "
"teda koľko vzoriek sa odoberie. Výsledkom je plynulejší efekt pre :dfn:"
"`Smear Mode` a nepriehľadnejší výsledok pre :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:84
msgid "There are two major types:"
msgstr "Existujú dva hlavné typy:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:87
msgid ""
"Copies the area underneath the previous position of the brush onto the new "
"position, taking opacity into account. This tends to result in a smear-"
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Skopíruje oblasť pod predchádzajúcou polohou štetca na novú polohu s "
"prihliadnutím na krytie. Výsledkom je zvyčajne efekt rozmazania."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:89
msgid ""
"Great for making brushes that have a very impasto oil feel to them. It's "
"recommended to have a low spacing for Smear, as this will result in a less "
"grainy looking smear."
msgstr ""
"Výborné na tvorbu štetcov s výraznou olejovou textúrou impasto. Pre Smear sa "
"odporúča nízky rozstup, čím sa dosiahne menej zrnatý vzhľad rozmazania."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:93
msgid "Smearing"
msgstr "Zotrvačnosť"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:93
msgid ""
"A variety of color smudge strokes in the :dfn:`Smear Mode` with different "
"opacities, smudge lengths and spacing. Left-hand set being the old algorithm "
"and the right-hand set the new algorithm. The bottom two strokes are using "
"the :ref:`bm_color_dodge` blending mode, which does not have any meaningful "
"effect, given the :ref:`option_color_rate` is set to 0%."
msgstr ""
"Rôzne ťahy color smudge v :dfn:`Smear Mode` s rôznym krytím, dĺžkami "
"rozmazania a rozstupmi. Ľavá sada používa starý algoritmus, pravá sada nový "
"algoritmus. Spodné dva ťahy používajú režim miešania :ref:`bm_color_dodge`, "
"ktorý nemá žiadny zmysluplný efekt, keďže :ref:`option_color_rate` je "
"nastavená na 0 %."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:96
msgid ""
"Picks the color underneath the brush dab (using the Smudge Radius, if "
"applicable), and first fills the whole dab with that before applying the "
"color and the opacity. Named so because it dulls strong colors."
msgstr ""
"Vyberie farbu pod dábom štetca (s použitím polomeru rozmazania, ak je to "
"možné) a najprv celý dáb touto farbou vyplní, a potom aplikuje farbu a "
"krytie. Pomenovaný takto, pretože utlmuje sýte farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:98
msgid ""
"Using an arithmetic blending type, Dulling is great for more smooth type of "
"painting. It's recommended to increase the spacing on dulling brushes as "
"much as possible without the stroke looking choppy, as it speeds up the "
"brush without losing smudge quality. The resulting stroke can be made "
"stronger by increasing the smudge radius or the opacity."
msgstr ""
"Pri použití aritmetického typu miešania je Dulling výborný pre plynulejší "
"typ maľovania. Odporúča sa čo najviac zvýšiť rozstup na štetcoch Dulling bez "
"toho, aby ťah vyzeral trhaný, čím sa štetec zrýchli bez straty kvality "
"rozmazania. Výsledný ťah možno zosilniť zvýšením polomeru rozmazania alebo "
"krytia."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:102
msgid "Dulling"
msgstr "Otupenie"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:102
msgid "Same as above, but then for the :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."
msgstr "Rovnaké ako vyššie, ale pre :dfn:`Dulling Mode`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:104
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Sila"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:105
msgid ""
"Affects how much the smudge length takes from the previous dab its sampling. "
"This means that smudge length at 100% will never decrease, but smudge "
"lengths under that will decrease based on :ref:`option_spacing` and :ref:"
"`Opacity <option_opacity_n_flow>`."
msgstr ""
"Ovplyvňuje, koľko dĺžka rozmazania odoberá z vzorkovania predchádzajúceho "
"dábu. To znamená, že dĺžka rozmazania na 100 % nikdy neklesne, ale dĺžky "
"rozmazania pod touto hodnotou budú klesať v závislosti od :ref:"
"`option_spacing` a :ref:`krytia <option_opacity_n_flow>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:107
msgid ""
"Controls whether the transparency of the smeared pixels is taken into "
"account when painting. This can be helpful to get a more opaque effect, as "
"if laying down thick layers of paint, without losing the smudge effect."
msgstr ""
"Určuje, či sa pri maľovaní zohľadňuje priehľadnosť rozmazaných pixelov. Môže "
"to pomôcť dosiahnuť nepriehľadnejší efekt, akoby sa nanášali hrubé vrstvy "
"farby, bez straty efektu rozmazania."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:111
msgid "Different strokes showing how smear alpha functions."
msgstr "Rôzne ťahy ukazujúce fungovanie smear alpha."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:113
msgid ":dfn:`Smear Mode` with :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."
msgstr ":dfn:`Smear Mode` so :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:114
msgid ":dfn:`Smear Mode` without :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."
msgstr ":dfn:`Smear Mode` bez :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:115
msgid ":dfn:`Dulling Mode` with :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."
msgstr ":dfn:`Dulling Mode` so :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:116
msgid ":dfn:`Dulling Mode` without :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."
msgstr ":dfn:`Dulling Mode` bez :dfn:`Smear Alpha`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:117
msgid "Smear Alpha"
msgstr "Rozmazať alfa"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:117
msgid ""
":dfn:`Dulling Mode` without :dfn:`Smear Alpha`, and :ref:"
"`option_smudge_radius` set to 100%."
msgstr ""
":dfn:`Dulling Mode` bez :dfn:`Smear Alpha` a :ref:`option_smudge_radius` "
"nastavený na 100 %."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:122
msgid "Use new smudge algorithm"
msgstr "Použiť nový algoritmus rozmazávania"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:122
msgid ""
"The new smudge algorithm was initially introduced to allow :ref:`lightness "
"and gradient modes <brush_mode>` on the color smudge. But it allows for "
"more: it is a little quicker, and it has a better separation between the :"
"ref:`option_color_rate` and the :dfn:`Smudge Length`."
msgstr ""
"Nový algoritmus rozmazávania bol pôvodne zavedený, aby umožnil :ref:`režimy "
"svetlosti a gradientu <brush_mode>` na color smudge. Prináša však viac: je o "
"niečo rýchlejší a má lepšie oddelenie medzi :ref:`option_color_rate` a :dfn:"
"`Smudge Length`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:125
msgid "Common behaviors:"
msgstr "Spoločné správanie:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:127
msgid ""
"Unchecking the smudge length function sets smudge length to 100% (not 0.00)."
msgstr ""
"Zrušenie zaškrtnutia funkcie dĺžky rozmazania nastaví dĺžku rozmazania na "
"100 % (nie 0,00)."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:128
msgid ""
"Opacity: Below 50%, there is practically no smudging left: keep opacity over "
"50%."
msgstr ""
"Krytie: Pod 50 % prakticky nezostáva žiadne rozmazávanie – udržujte krytie "
"nad 50 %."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:131
msgid "Differences:"
msgstr "Rozdiely:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:133
msgid ""
"Spacing with Smearing: the lower the spacing, the smoother the effect, so "
"for smearing with a round brush you may prefer a value of 0.05 or less. "
"Spacing affects the length of the smudge trail, but to a much lesser extent. "
"The :guilabel:`strength` of the effect remains more or less the same however."
msgstr ""
"Rozstup pri rozmazávaní: čím nižší rozstup, tým plynulejší efekt – pri "
"rozmazávaní okrúhlym štetcom môžete uprednostniť hodnotu 0,05 alebo menej. "
"Rozstup ovplyvňuje dĺžku stopy rozmazania, avšak v oveľa menšej miere. :"
"guilabel:`strength` efektu však zostáva viac-menej rovnaká."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:134
msgid ""
"Spacing with Dulling: the lower the spacing, the stronger the effect: "
"lowering the spacing too much can make the dulling effect too strong (it "
"picks up a color and never lets go of it). The length of the effect is also "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Rozstup pri utlmovaní: čím nižší rozstup, tým silnejší efekt – príliš nízky "
"rozstup môže spôsobiť, že efekt utlmovania bude príliš silný (vyberie farbu "
"a nikdy ju nepustí). Ovplyvnená je aj dĺžka efektu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:135
msgid ""
"Both Smearing and Dulling have a \"smudge trail\", but in the case of "
"Dulling, the brush shape is preserved. Instead, the trail determines how "
"fast the color it picked up is dropped off."
msgstr ""
"Smearing aj Dulling majú „stopu rozmazania\", no v prípade Dulling sa "
"zachováva tvar štetca. Stopa namiesto toho určuje, ako rýchlo sa vybraná "
"farba uvoľňuje."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:140
msgid "Smudge Radius"
msgstr "Polomer rozmazania"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:142
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Smudge Radius` allows you to sample a larger radius when "
"using smudge-length in :guilabel:`Dulling` mode."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Smudge Radius` umožňuje vzorkovanie väčšieho polomeru pri použití "
"dĺžky rozmazania v režime :guilabel:`Dulling`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:144
msgid ""
"The slider is percentage of the brush-size. You can have it modified with :"
"guilabel:`Sensors`."
msgstr ""
"Posuvník je percentom veľkosti štetca. Môžete ho upraviť pomocou :guilabel:"
"`Sensors`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:148
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_smudge_radius.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2.9_brushengine_smudge_radius_01.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:148
msgid ""
"A variety of brush strokes using 50% color rate, 50% smudge length and 50% "
"opacity, but different smudge radii. The top stroke is in :dfn:`smear mode` "
"and thus smudge radius is not in effect."
msgstr ""
"Rôzne ťahy štetca s 50% farebnou rýchlosťou, 50% dĺžkou rozmazania a 50% "
"krytím, ale s rôznymi polomermi rozmazania. Horný ťah je v :dfn:`smear "
"mode`, takže polomer rozmazania nie je aktívny."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:152
msgid ""
"In versions prior to 5.0, Smudge Radius can go up to 3,00,00%, while the "
"program's internal value is 1/100 of the displayed value. Starting from 5.0, "
"the displayed and the internal value of Smudge Radius are unified, they can "
"only go up to 300%, as intended."
msgstr ""
"Vo verziách pred 5.0 mohol Smudge Radius dosahovať až 3 000 %, pričom "
"vnútorná hodnota programu bola 1/100 zobrazenej hodnoty. Od verzie 5.0 sú "
"zobrazená a vnútorná hodnota Smudge Radius zjednotené a môžu dosahovať iba "
"do 300 %, ako bolo zamýšľané."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:157
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "Prekryť"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:159
msgid ""
"Overlay is a toggle that determine whether the smudge brush will sample all "
"layers (overlay on), or only the current one."
msgstr ""
"Overlay je prepínač, ktorý určuje, či štetec rozmazania bude vzorkovať "
"všetky vrstvy (overlay zapnutý), alebo len aktuálnu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:161
msgid ""
"By default, the Color Smudge Brush only takes information from the layer it "
"is on. However, if you want it to take color information from all the "
"layers, you can turn on the Overlay mode."
msgstr ""
"Štandardne Color Smudge Brush odoberá informácie iba z vrstvy, na ktorej sa "
"nachádza. Ak však chcete, aby odoberalo farebné informácie zo všetkých "
"vrstiev, môžete zapnúť režim Overlay."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:163
msgid ""
"Be aware though, that it does so by \"picking up\" bits of the layer "
"underneath, which may mess up your drawing if you later make changes to the "
"layer underneath."
msgstr ""
"Uvedomte si však, že robí to tak, že „odoberie\" kúsky vrstvy nižšie, čo "
"môže narušiť váš výkres, ak neskôr urobíte zmeny vo vrstve nižšie."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:168
msgid "Paint Thickness"
msgstr "Hrúbka náteru"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:172
msgid ""
"This affects how strong the :ref:`lightness modes <brush_mode>` affect the "
"current color. Because the :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` smudges, what actually "
"happens is that the lightness part is painted into a separate height map. "
"This prevents the shadows and highlights of the current lightness brush tip "
"from being mixed into the smudge, which would have resulted in all smudges "
"becoming white or black. The height map is discarded when switching brush "
"engines, layers or tools. Because this heightmap only exists for the layer "
"currently being edited, lightness brushes and paint thickness cannot be used "
"together with :ref:`option_overlay`."
msgstr ""
"Ovplyvňuje, ako silno :ref:`režimy svetlosti <brush_mode>` ovplyvňujú "
"aktuálnu farbu. Keďže :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` rozmazáva, v skutočnosti sa "
"časť svetlosti namaľuje do oddelenej výškovej mapy. Tým sa zabraňuje "
"miešaniu tieňov a odleskov aktuálneho hrotu štetca svetlosti do rozmazania, "
"čo by spôsobilo, že všetky rozmazania by sa stali bielymi alebo čiernymi. "
"Výšková mapa sa zahodí pri prepínaní enginov štetcov, vrstiev alebo "
"nástrojov. Keďže táto výšková mapa existuje iba pre aktuálne upravovanú "
"vrstvu, štetce svetlosti a hrúbku farby nemožno používať spolu s :ref:"
"`option_overlay`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:176
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_paint_thickness_strength."
"png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2.9_brushengine_smudge_length_01.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:176
msgid ""
"Image showing off different variations of :dfn:`Paint Thickness`, with the "
"top three strokes being in :dfn:`Smear Mode` and the bottom three in :dfn:"
"`Dulling Mode`. Strengths are 100%, 50%, and 0% from top to bottom."
msgstr ""
"Obrázok zobrazujúci rôzne variácie :dfn:`Paint Thickness`, pričom horné tri "
"ťahy sú v :dfn:`Smear Mode` a spodné tri v :dfn:`Dulling Mode`. Sily sú 100 "
"%, 50 % a 0 % zhora nadol."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:178
msgid ""
"This has two modes, which change how the existing heightmap is interpreted:"
msgstr ""
"Toto má dva režimy, ktoré menia spôsob interpretácie existujúcej výškovej "
"mapy:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:180
msgid "Overwrite (Smooth out when low) existing paint thickness"
msgstr "Prepísať (Vyhladiť pri nízkej) existujúcu hrúbku náteru"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:181
msgid ""
"Here the lightness value of the brushstroke overrides the value that was "
"there before, effectively smoothing out previous paint if the thickness "
"value is low. The Opacity setting will cause it to blend with the previous "
"paint height, but that will also bring down the color. This mode is useful "
"for a brush that can paint with thickness, but can also smooth out existing "
"paint if you wish."
msgstr ""
"Tu hodnota svetlosti ťahu štetca prepíše hodnotu, ktorá tam bola predtým, "
"čím účinne vyhladí predchádzajúcu farbu, ak je hodnota hrúbky nízka. "
"Nastavenie Nepriehľadnosti spôsobí miešanie s predchádzajúcou výškou farby, "
"ale zároveň zníži intenzitu farby. Tento režim je užitočný pre štetec, ktorý "
"môže maľovať s hrúbkou, ale v prípade potreby môže aj vyhladiť existujúcu "
"farbu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:183
msgid "Paint over existing paint thickness (controlled by smudge length)"
msgstr "Maľovanie cez existujúcu hrúbku farby (riadené dĺžkou rozmazania)"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:183
msgid ""
"Here the lightness value blends with the previous values, based on the "
"Smudge Length, as described above. It allows the kind of blending with "
"previous paint height that Opacity allows in the Overwrite mode, but without "
"affecting the color rate."
msgstr ""
"Tu sa hodnota svetlosti mieša s predchádzajúcimi hodnotami na základe dĺžky "
"rozmazania, ako je opísané vyššie. Umožňuje rovnaký druh miešania s "
"predchádzajúcou výškou farby, aký Nepriehľadnosť umožňuje v režime "
"Prepísania, ale bez vplyvu na mieru farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:187
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_paint_thickness_type.svg"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2_9_brushengine_colorrate_04.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:187
msgid ""
"Image demonstrating the two modes, with the top strokes being :dfn:"
"`Overwrite Existing Paint Thickness` and the bottom strokes :dfn:`Paint over "
"existing paint thickness`. In both cases, a red stroke was laid with 100% "
"paint thickness. Blue strokes were overlaid going from thin to thick. Notice "
"how the :dfn:`Paint over existing` type differs between 0% and 100% :dfn:"
"`Smudge Length`."
msgstr ""
"Obrázok demonštrujúci dva režimy, kde horné ťahy sú :dfn:`Overwrite Existing "
"Paint Thickness` a dolné ťahy :dfn:`Paint over existing paint thickness`. V "
"oboch prípadoch bol položený červený ťah so 100% hrúbkou farby. Modré ťahy "
"boli nanesené od tenkých po hrubé. Všimnite si, ako sa typ :dfn:`Paint over "
"existing` líši medzi 0% a 100% :dfn:`Smudge Length`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:192
msgid "Hue, Saturation, Value"
msgstr "Odtieň, nasýtenie, hodnota"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:194
msgid ""
"Identical to :ref:`option_hue_sat_val_pixel` in the Pixel Brush Engine, this "
"will adjust the current foreground color before it is mixed in via :ref:"
"`option_color_rate`. Introduced because this brush engine used to have a "
"small rounding error leading to iridescent smears, which was fixed. Artists "
"who liked this effect can now emulate it by enabling :guilabel:`Hue`, "
"enabling :guilabel:`Fuzzy Dab` and disabling :guilabel:`Pressure` and "
"finally setting :guilabel:`Strength` to 40%."
msgstr ""
"Rovnako ako :ref:`option_hue_sat_val_pixel` v engine Pixel Brush, toto "
"upraví aktuálnu farbu popredia pred jej zmiešaním cez :ref:"
"`option_color_rate`. Bolo zavedené, pretože tento engine štetca mal malú "
"chybu zaokrúhľovania vedúcu k dúhovým šmuhám, ktorá bola opravená. Umelci, "
"ktorým sa tento efekt páčil, ho teraz môžu napodobniť zapnutím :guilabel:"
"`Hue`, zapnutím :guilabel:`Fuzzy Dab` a vypnutím :guilabel:`Pressure` a "
"nakoniec nastavením :guilabel:`Strength` na 40%."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:198
msgid ""
".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/brushengine_smudge_hue_variance.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita_2.9_brushengine_smudge_length_01.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:198
msgid "*Top*: without hue variance, *Bottom*: with hue variance."
msgstr "*Hore*: bez variácie odtieňa, *Dole*: s variáciou odtieňa."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:200
msgid ""
"Hue, Saturation and Value don't affect brush-tips using the :ref:`gradient "
"mode <brush_mode>`."
msgstr ""
"Odtieň, Sýtosť a Hodnota neovplyvňujú hroty štetca používajúce :ref:"
"`gradient mode <brush_mode>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:203
msgid "Brush tips"
msgstr "Špičky štetcov"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:205
msgid ""
"The :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` has all the same :ref:`option_brush_tip` as "
"the :ref:`pixel_brush_engine`!"
msgstr ""
":dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` má všetky rovnaké :ref:`option_brush_tip` ako :ref:"
"`pixel_brush_engine`!"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:208
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-I.4.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-I.4.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:209
msgid ""
"Just remember that the smudge effects are weaker when a brush tip's opacity "
"is lower, so for low-opacity brush tips, increase the opacity and smudge/"
"color rates."
msgstr ""
"Pamätajte, že efekty rozmazania sú slabšie, keď je nepriehľadnosť hrotu "
"štetca nižšia, takže pri hrotoch štetca s nízkou nepriehľadnosťou zvýšte "
"nepriehľadnosť a miery rozmazania/farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:212
msgid "Scatter and other shape dynamics"
msgstr "Rozptyl a iná dynamika tvaru"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:214
msgid ""
"The :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` shares a number of options with the :ref:"
"`pixel_brush_engine`."
msgstr ""
":dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` zdieľa niekoľko možností s :ref:"
"`pixel_brush_engine`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:216
msgid ""
"However, because of the Smudge effects, the outcome will be different from "
"the Pixel Brush. In particular, the Scatter option becomes much more "
"significant."
msgstr ""
"Avšak kvôli efektom rozmazania bude výsledok odlišný od Pixel Brush. "
"Obzvlášť možnosť Rozptyl sa stáva oveľa významnejšou."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:219
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-I.5-1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-I.5-1.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:220
msgid "A few things to note:"
msgstr "Niekoľko vecí na poznámku:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:222
msgid ""
"Scattering is proportional to the brush size. It's fine to use a scattering "
"of 500% for a tiny round brush, but for bigger brushes, you may want to get "
"it down to 50% or less."
msgstr ""
"Rozptyl je úmerný veľkosti štetca. Pre malý okrúhly štetec je v poriadku "
"použiť rozptyl 500%, ale pre väčšie štetce ho možno budete chcieť znížiť na "
"50% alebo menej."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:223
msgid ""
"You may notice the lines with the :guilabel:`Smearing` option. Those are "
"caused by the fact that it picked up the hard lines of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Možno si všimnete čiary pri možnosti :guilabel:`Smearing`. Sú spôsobené tým, "
"že štetec zachytil ostré línie obdĺžnika."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:224
msgid ""
"For scattering, the brush picks up colors within a certain distance, not the "
"color directly under the paintbrush:"
msgstr ""
"Pri rozptyle štetec zachytáva farby v určitej vzdialenosti, nie farbu priamo "
"pod štetcom:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:228
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-I.5-2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-I.5-2.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:230
msgid "Tutorial: Color Smudge Brushes"
msgstr "Návod: Štetce Color Smudge"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:232
msgid ""
"I recommend at least skimming over the first part to get an idea of what "
"does what."
msgstr ""
"Odporúčam aspoň preletnúť prvú časť, aby ste získali predstavu o tom, čo čo "
"robí."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:235
msgid "Smudging and blending"
msgstr "Rozmazávanie a miešanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:237
msgid "This part describes use cases with color rate off."
msgstr "Táto časť popisuje prípady použitia s vypnutou mierou farby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:239
msgid ""
"I won't explain the settings for dynamics in detail, as you can find the "
"explanations in the :ref:`Pixel Brush tutorial <pixel_brush_engine>`."
msgstr ""
"Nebudem podrobne vysvetľovať nastavenia dynamiky, pretože vysvetlenia "
"nájdete v :ref:`Pixel Brush tutorial <pixel_brush_engine>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:242
msgid "Smudging effects"
msgstr "Efekty rozmazania"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:244
msgid "For simple smudging:"
msgstr "Pre jednoduché rozmazanie:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:246
msgid "Pick the Color Smudge Brush. You can use either Smearing or Dulling."
msgstr "Vyberte Color Smudge Brush. Môžete použiť buď Smearing alebo Dulling."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:248
msgid "Turn off Color Rate"
msgstr "Vypnite Color Rate"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:250
msgid "Smudge away"
msgstr "Rozmazávajte"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:253
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-II.2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-II.2.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:254
msgid ""
"When using lower opacity brush tips, remember to \"compensate\" for the less "
"visible effects by increasing both :guilabel:`Smudge Rate` and :guilabel:"
"`Opacity`, if necessary to maximum."
msgstr ""
"Pri používaní hrotov štetca s nižšou nepriehľadnosťou nezabudnite "
"\"kompenzovať\" menej viditeľné efekty zvýšením :guilabel:`Smudge Rate` aj :"
"guilabel:`Opacity`, ak je to potrebné, na maximum."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:257
msgid "Some settings for Smearing"
msgstr "Niektoré nastavenia pre Smearing"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:259
msgid ""
"For smoother smearing, decrease spacing. Remember that spacing is "
"proportional to brush tip size. For a small round brush, 0.10 spacing is "
"fine, but for mid-sized and large brushes, decrease spacing to 0.05 or less."
msgstr ""
"Pre hladšie rozmazávanie znížte rozostup. Pamätajte, že rozostup je úmerný "
"veľkosti hrotu štetca. Pre malý okrúhly štetec je v poriadku rozostup 0,10, "
"ale pre stredne veľké a veľké štetce znížte rozostup na 0,05 alebo menej."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:262
msgid "Some settings for Dulling"
msgstr "Niektoré nastavenia pre Dulling"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:264
msgid ""
"Lowering the spacing will also make the smudging effect stronger, so find a "
"right balance. 0.10 for most mid-sized round brushes should be fine."
msgstr ""
"Zníženie rozostupu tiež zosilní efekt rozmazania, takže nájdite správnu "
"rovnováhu. 0,10 by malo byť v poriadku pre väčšinu stredne veľkých okrúhlych "
"štetcov."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:265
msgid ""
"Unlike Smearing, Dulling preserves the brush shape and size, so it won't "
"\"fade off\" in size like Smearing brushes do. You can mimic that effect "
"through the simple size fade dynamic."
msgstr ""
"Na rozdiel od Smearing, Dulling zachováva tvar a veľkosť štetca, takže sa "
"veľkosťou \"nevytrácí\" ako štetce Smearing. Tento efekt môžete napodobniť "
"prostredníctvom jednoduchej dynamiky postupného zmenšovania veľkosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:268
msgid "Textured blending"
msgstr "Textúrované miešanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:270
msgid ""
"In this case, what I refer to as \"Blending\" here is simply using one of "
"the following two dynamics:"
msgstr ""
"V tomto prípade to, čo tu nazývam \"Blending\", je jednoducho použitie "
"jednej z nasledujúcich dvoch dynamík:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:272
msgid ":guilabel:`Rotation` set to :guilabel:`Distance` or :guilabel:`Fuzzy`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Rotation` nastavené na :guilabel:`Distance` alebo :guilabel:"
"`Fuzzy`"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:275
msgid ""
"For most mid-sized brushes you will probably want to lower the scatter rate "
"to 50% or lower. Higher settings are okay for tiny brushes."
msgstr ""
"Pre väčšinu stredne veľkých štetcov budete pravdepodobne chcieť znížiť mieru "
"rozptylu na 50% alebo menej. Vyššie nastavenia sú v poriadku pre malé štetce."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:276
msgid "And/or Scatter:"
msgstr "A/alebo Scatter:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:276
msgid ""
"Note that Scatter picks colors within a certain distance, not the color "
"directly under the brush (see :ref:`option_brush_tip`)."
msgstr ""
"Všimnite si, že Scatter zachytáva farby v určitej vzdialenosti, nie farbu "
"priamo pod štetcom (pozri :ref:`option_brush_tip`)."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:278
msgid ""
"Optional: Pile on size and other dynamics and vary brush tips. In fact, the :"
"dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` is not a blur brush, so smudging is not a very good "
"method of \"smooth\" blending. To blend smoothly, you'll have better luck "
"with:"
msgstr ""
"Voliteľné: Pridajte veľkosť a inú dynamiku a meňte hroty štetca. V "
"skutočnosti :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` nie je rozmazávací štetec, takže "
"rozmazávanie nie je veľmi dobrá metóda \"plynulého\" miešania. Pre plynulé "
"miešanie budete mať väčší úspech s:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:279
msgid ""
"Building up the transition by painting with intermediate values, described "
"later"
msgstr "Budovanie prechodu maľovaním s medzihodnotami, opísané neskôr"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:280
msgid ""
"Or using the \"blur with feathered selection\" method that I'll briefly "
"mention at the end of this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Alebo pomocou metódy \"rozmazanie s pernatým výberom\", ktorú krátko "
"spomeniem na konci tohto návodu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:282
msgid ""
"I've tried to achieve smooth blending with :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` by "
"adding rotation and scatter dynamics, but honestly they looked like crap."
msgstr ""
"Skúšal som dosiahnuť plynulé miešanie pomocou :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` "
"pridaním dynamiky rotácie a rozptylu, ale úprimne povedané, vyzerali hrozne."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:284
msgid ""
"However, the :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` is very good at \"textured blending\":"
msgstr ""
"Avšak :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` je veľmi dobrý v \"textúrovanom miešaní\":"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:287
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-II.3.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-II.3.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:288
msgid "Basically you can paint first and add textured transitions after."
msgstr "V podstate môžete najprv maľovať a potom pridať textúrované prechody."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:291
msgid "Coloring"
msgstr "Farbenie"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:293
msgid "For this last section, :guilabel:`Color Rate` is on."
msgstr "Pre túto poslednú časť je :guilabel:`Color Rate` zapnuté."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:296
msgid "Layer options"
msgstr "Možnosti vrstvy"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:298
msgid ""
"Before we get started, notice that you have several possibilities for your "
"set-up:"
msgstr ""
"Pred začatím si všimnite, že máte niekoľko možností pre vaše nastavenie:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:300
msgid "Shading on the same layer"
msgstr "Tieňovanie na tej istej vrstve"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:301
msgid ""
"Shading on a separate layer, possibly making use of alpha-inheritance. The "
"brush blends with the transparency of the layer it's on. This means:"
msgstr ""
"Tieňovanie na samostatnej vrstve, prípadne využívajúce dedičnosť alfa. "
"Štetec sa mieša s priehľadnosťou vrstvy, na ktorej je. To znamená:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:303
msgid ""
"If the area underneath is more of less uniform, the output is actually "
"similar as if shading on the same layer"
msgstr ""
"Ak je oblasť pod ním viac-menej rovnomerná, výsledok je vlastne podobný, "
"akoby sa tieňovalo na tej istej vrstve"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:305
msgid ""
"But if the area underneath is not uniform, then you'll get fewer color "
"variations."
msgstr ""
"Ale ak oblasť pod ním nie je rovnomerná, dostanete menej farebných variácií."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:307
msgid ""
"Shading on a separate layer, using :ref:`option_overlay` mode. Use this only "
"if you're fairly sure you don't need to adjust the layer below, or the "
"colors may become a mess."
msgstr ""
"Tieňovanie na samostatnej vrstve pomocou režimu :ref:`option_overlay`. "
"Použite to iba vtedy, ak ste si celkom istí, že nepotrebujete upravovať "
"vrstvu nižšie, inak sa farby môžu zmiasť."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:310
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-1.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:312
msgid "Issue with transparency"
msgstr "Problém s priehľadnosťou"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:314
msgid ""
"The :dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` blends with transparency. What this means is "
"that when you start a new, transparent layer and \"paint\" on this layer, "
"you will nearly always get less than full opacity."
msgstr ""
":dfn:`Color Smudge Brush` sa mieša s priehľadnosťou. To znamená, že keď "
"začnete novú, priehľadnú vrstvu a \"maľujete\" na tejto vrstve, takmer vždy "
"dostanete menej ako plnú nepriehľadnosť."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:316
msgid "Basically:"
msgstr "V podstate:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:318
msgid "It may look great when you're coloring on a blank canvas"
msgstr "Môže to vyzerať skvele, keď farbíte na prázdnom plátne"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:319
msgid "But it won't look so great when you add something underneath"
msgstr "Ale nebude to vyzerať tak skvele, keď pridáte niečo pod to"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:322
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-2.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:323
msgid "The solution is pretty simple though:"
msgstr "Riešenie je však celkom jednoduché:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:326
msgid ""
"With tinting, you already have the color underneath colored, so that's done"
msgstr "Pri tintingu už máte farbu pod ním vyfarbenou, takže to je hotové"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:327
msgid "Make sure you have the area underneath colored in first:"
msgstr "Uistite sa, že máte oblasť pod ním najprv vyfarbenú:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:327
msgid "For painting, roughly color in the background layer first"
msgstr "Pri maľovaní najprv hrubо vyfarbite vrstvu pozadia"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:328
msgid "Or color in the shape on a new layer and make use of alpha-inheritance"
msgstr "Alebo vyfarbite tvar na novej vrstve a využite dedičnosť alfa"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:329
msgid ""
"For the last solution, use colors that contrast highly with what you're "
"using for best effect. For example, shade in the darkest shadow area first, "
"or the lightest highlights, and use the color smudge brush for the "
"contrasting color."
msgstr ""
"Pre posledné riešenie použite farby, ktoré výrazne kontrastujú s tým, čo "
"používate, pre najlepší efekt. Napríklad najprv tieňujte v najtmavšej "
"oblasti tieňa alebo najsvetlejších svetlách a použite štetec color smudge "
"pre kontrastnú farbu."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:332
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-3.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.1-3.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:334
msgid "Soft-shading"
msgstr "Mäkké tieňovanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:336
msgid "Suppose you want more or less smooth color transitions. You can either:"
msgstr ""
"Predpokladajme, že chcete viac-menej plynulé farebné prechody. Môžete buď:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:338
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color Rate` as low as 10% for round brushes, higher with non "
"fully opaque brush tips."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Color Rate` tak nízke ako 10% pre okrúhle štetce, vyššie pri nie "
"plne nepriehľadných hrotoch štetca."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:339
msgid "Or set the :guilabel:`Smudge Rate` as low as 10% instead."
msgstr ""
"Alebo namiesto toho nastavte :guilabel:`Smudge Rate` tak nízke ako 10%."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:340
msgid ""
"Or a combination of the two. Please try yourself for the output you like "
"best."
msgstr ""
"Alebo kombináciu oboch. Prosím, vyskúšajte sami, aby ste dosiahli výsledok, "
"ktorý sa vám najviac páči."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:341
msgid "Optional: turn on :guilabel:`Rotation` for smoother blending."
msgstr "Voliteľné: zapnite :guilabel:`Rotation` pre plynulejšie miešanie."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:342
msgid "Optional: turn on :guilabel:`Scatter` for certain effects."
msgstr "Voliteľné: zapnite :guilabel:`Scatter` pre určité efekty."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:343
msgid ""
"Optional: fiddle with :guilabel:`Size` and :guilabel:`Opacity` dynamics as "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľné: experimentujte s dynamikou :guilabel:`Size` a :guilabel:`Opacity` "
"podľa potreby."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:346
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.2-1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.2-1.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:347
msgid ""
"This remains, in fact, a so-so way of making smooth transitions. It's best "
"to build up intermediate values instead. Here:"
msgstr ""
"Toto zostáva v skutočnosti priemerným spôsobom vytvárania plynulých "
"prechodov. Najlepšie je namiesto toho budovať medzihodnotami. Tu:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:349
msgid ""
"I first passed over the blue area three times with a red color. I select 3 "
"shades."
msgstr ""
"Najprv som prešiel nad modrou oblasťou trikrát červenou farbou. Vyberiem 3 "
"odtiene."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:350
msgid ""
"I color picked each of these values with the :kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| "
"shortcut, then used them in succession."
msgstr ""
"Každú z týchto hodnôt som vyzdvihol farbou pomocou skratky :kbd:`Ctrl +` |"
"mouseleft|, potom som ich použil postupne."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:353
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.2-2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.2-2.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:355
msgid "Painting: thick oil style"
msgstr "Maľovanie: štýl hustého oleja"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:357
msgid ""
"Many of the included color smudge brush presets produce a thick oil paint-"
"like effect. This is mainly achieved with the Smearing mode on. Basically:"
msgstr ""
"Mnoho zahrnutých prednastavení štetca color smudge vytvára efekt podobný "
"hustej olejovej farbe. Toto sa dosahuje hlavne so zapnutým režimom Smearing. "
"V podstate:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:361
msgid ""
"Both at 0.50 are fine for normal round brushes or fully opaque predefined "
"brushes"
msgstr ""
"Obe hodnoty na 0,50 sú v poriadku pre normálne okrúhle štetce alebo plne "
"nepriehľadné predefinované štetce"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:362
msgid "Smearing mode with high smudge and color rates"
msgstr "Režim Smearing s vysokými mierami rozmazania a farby"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:362
msgid ""
"Up to 1.00 each for brushes with less density or non fully-opaque predefined "
"brushes"
msgstr ""
"Až 1,00 pre každý štetec s menšou hustotou alebo nie plne nepriehľadné "
"predefinované štetce"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:364
msgid ""
"Add Size/Rotation/Scatter dynamics as needed. When you do this, increase "
"smudge and color rates to compensate for increased color mixing."
msgstr ""
"Pridajte dynamiku Size/Rotation/Scatter podľa potreby. Keď to urobíte, "
"zvýšte miery rozmazania a farby, aby ste kompenzovali zvýšené miešanie "
"farieb."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:367
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-1.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:368
msgid ""
"One thing I really like to do is to set different foreground and background "
"colors, then turn on :menuselection:`Gradient --> Fuzzy`. Alternatively, "
"just paint with different colors in succession (bottom-right example)."
msgstr ""
"Jedna vec, ktorú naozaj rád robím, je nastaviť rôzne farby popredia a "
"pozadia, potom zapnúť :menuselection:`Gradient --> Fuzzy`. Prípadne "
"jednoducho maľujte rôznymi farbami postupne (príklad vpravo dole)."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:371
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-2.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:372
msgid ""
"Here's some final random stuff. With pixel brushes, you can get all sorts of "
"frill designs by using elongated brushes and setting the dynamics to "
"rotation. You won't get that with Color Smudge Brushes. Instead, you'll get "
"something that looks more like... yarn. Which is cool too. Here, I just used "
"oval brushes and :menuselection:`Rotation --> Distance`."
msgstr ""
"Tu je niekoľko záverečných náhodných vecí. S pixelovými štetcami môžete "
"získať všetky druhy okrajových vzorov pomocou predĺžených štetcov a "
"nastavením dynamiky na rotáciu. To s Color Smudge Brushes nezískate. "
"Namiesto toho dostanete niečo, čo vyzerá viac ako... priadza. Čo je tiež "
"cool. Tu som použil iba oválne štetce a :menuselection:`Rotation --> "
"Distance`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:375
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-3.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.3-3.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:377
msgid "Painting: Digital watercolor style"
msgstr "Maľovanie: Štýl digitálnej akvarely"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:379
msgid ""
"When I say \"digital watercolor\", it refers to a style often seen online, i."
"e. a soft, smooth shading style rather than realistic watercolor. For this "
"you mostly need the Dulling mode. A few things:"
msgstr ""
"Keď hovorím \"digitálna akvarel\", odkazujem na štýl, ktorý sa často vidí "
"online, t.j. mäkký, plynulý štýl tieňovania skôr ako realistická akvarel. Na "
"to väčšinou potrebujete režim Dulling. Niekoľko vecí:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:381
msgid ""
"Contrary to the Smearing mode, you may want to lower opacity for normal "
"round brushes to get a smoother effect, to 70% for example."
msgstr ""
"Na rozdiel od režimu Smearing môžete chcieť znížiť nepriehľadnosť pre "
"normálne okrúhle štetce, aby ste dosiahli hladší efekt, napríklad na 70%."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:382
msgid "Vary the brush tip fade value as well."
msgstr "Taktiež meňte hodnotu vytrácania hrotu štetca."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:383
msgid ""
"When using :guilabel:`Scatter` or other dynamics, you can choose to set "
"smudge and color values to high or low values, for different outcomes."
msgstr ""
"Pri používaní :guilabel:`Scatter` alebo inej dynamiky môžete nastaviť "
"hodnoty rozmazania a farby na vysoké alebo nízke hodnoty pre rôzne výsledky."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:386
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.4.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.4.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:388
msgid "Blurring"
msgstr "Rozmazávanie (blur)"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:390
msgid "You can:"
msgstr "Môžete:"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:392
msgid "Paint then smudge, for mostly texture transitions"
msgstr "Maľujte a potom rozmazávajte, pre väčšinou textúrové prechody"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:393
msgid "Or build up transitions by using intermediate color values"
msgstr "Alebo budujte prechody pomocou medziľahlých farebných hodnôt"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:395
msgid ""
"If you want even smoother effects, well, just use blur. Gaussian blur to be "
"exact."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete ešte hladšie efekty, jednoducho použite blur. Konkrétne Gaussovský "
"blur."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:398
msgid ".. image:: /images/brushes/colorsmudge/Krita-tutorial5-III.5.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/en/Krita-tutorial5-III.5.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_engines/color_smudge_engine.rst:399
msgid "And there you go. That last little trick concludes this tutorial."
msgstr "A tu ste. Tento posledný malý trik uzatvára tento návod."

